WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.580 --> 00:00:04.160
HENRY:
Our legacy isn't how many commas
we have in our bank account.

00:00:04.160 --> 00:00:06.360
It's who we're looking up
to have in our lives.

00:00:06.360 --> 00:00:07.820
And what we can
lead them with.

00:00:07.820 --> 00:00:08.640
Henry!

00:00:08.640 --> 00:00:11.760
Remind me again why we can't
put you on a gifted school.

00:00:11.760 --> 00:00:13.820
'Cause it's better for
my Psycho Social Development,

00:00:13.820 --> 00:00:17.080
for me to interact with the peer group
at a normal school enviromenmt.

00:00:17.080 --> 00:00:17.860
[WHISPERS]
Oh, yeah.

00:00:18.300 --> 00:00:21.140
[Music]

00:00:23.020 --> 00:00:26.640
Hey, Susan. I guess I can just send it
over Direct Deposit, if that's easier.

00:00:26.640 --> 00:00:28.620
I-I don't know.
I'll have to ask Henry.

00:00:28.620 --> 00:00:29.780
You have to ask
your eleven-year old?

00:00:29.780 --> 00:00:33.320
Did our Financial Statement
come in the mail, today?

00:00:33.320 --> 00:00:35.280
Yeah, I forgot to
give it to you.

00:00:35.280 --> 00:00:37.620
I don't know how you do
it, all by yourself.

00:00:37.620 --> 00:00:38.780
Come on!
I have Henry.

00:00:38.780 --> 00:00:42.960
Find me another Male of the species,
who's more grown-up than him.

00:00:42.960 --> 00:00:44.360
I'd like to.

00:00:46.020 --> 00:00:48.840
The story,
is about me,

00:00:48.840 --> 00:00:52.120
my brother, my mom, and 
the girl who lived next door.

00:00:52.120 --> 00:00:54.820
Henry and Peter,
they're lucky to have you.

00:00:54.820 --> 00:00:56.500
And your fathers lucky
to have you too.

00:00:56.500 --> 00:00:58.080
Stepfather.

00:01:02.080 --> 00:01:03.840
- You okay?
- Yeah, I'm good.

00:01:04.340 --> 00:01:07.320
Mom, I have to tell you something
and it's very important.

00:01:07.320 --> 00:01:09.380
Christina's in trouble.

00:01:09.380 --> 00:01:11.760
When someone hurts someone else,
we have to make it better.

00:01:11.760 --> 00:01:14.880
There's only one
way to stop it.

00:01:14.880 --> 00:01:18.480
I'd hope to do it all myself,
but that's not an option.

00:01:18.480 --> 00:01:21.200
There has to be another
way to help Christina.

00:01:22.740 --> 00:01:25.440
Why, there's no
way, to help...

00:01:28.000 --> 00:01:30.120
Mr. Sickleman, is
the Police Commissioner.

00:01:30.120 --> 00:01:33.940
I'm not gonna subject him to public
scrutiny without conclusive evidence.

00:01:42.500 --> 00:01:44.660
[WHISPERS]
Okay, let's do this.

00:01:47.000 --> 00:01:49.640
Mom, everything you
need is right here.

00:01:50.440 --> 00:01:52.520
I'll be with you
the whole time.

00:01:56.280 --> 00:01:57.880
I know what
you've done.

00:01:57.880 --> 00:01:59.400
And we documented
all of it.

00:01:59.400 --> 00:02:01.280
Who do you think
they're gonna believe?

00:02:02.960 --> 00:02:04.340
It can't be
left undone.

00:02:04.340 --> 00:02:08.520
- No matter what, don't panic.
- I'm not panicking!

00:02:13.000 --> 00:02:14.680
We have to
make it better.

